"d"],["pc","d"],["pc","da"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","wd"],["hs","ed"],["at","and finds diamonds breaking 4-1, "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["ls","ed"],["hs","sh"],["hs","nh"],["at","it will be too late to play on hearts. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["ls","nh"],["hs","ws"],["hs","es"],["hs","ed"],["hc","hq"],["at","The defense will be able to cash 2 spade tricks and 2 diamond tricks in addition to a heart trick."],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["ls","es"],["ls","ed"],["lc","hq"],["up","8"],["md","0,d9,,hk"],["hs","sd"],["hs","nd"],["nt","\nSome bridge problems can be solved only by using probabilities. 3 diamond tricks can be taken "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["ls","nd"],["hs","wd"],["hs","ed"],["at","if that suit divides 3-2. A 3-2 break will occur about 68% of the time. "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["ls","ed"],["md","0,hk,,d9"],["hs","wh"],["at","An extra trick in hearts can be taken if West has either the @HK or the @HQ or both honours. West will have 1 or more heart honours about 76% of the time. "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["hs","sh"],["hs","nh"],["at","It is, therefore, superior to play on hearts."],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["ls","nh"],["hs","sh"],["nt","\nSouth leads a low heart "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["hs","wh"],["at","and when West follows low, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["pc","h"],["hs","nh"],["at","so does dummy. "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","h"],["hs","eh"],["at","East can win the trick "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["pc","hq"],["pg",""],["hs","ws"],["hs","es"],["at","and the defense will cash their spades."],["pg",""],["ls","es"],["ls","ws"],["pc","sj"],["pc","d"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["pc","s"],["pc","d"],["pc","s"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","wc"],["nt","\nAfter regaining the lead, "],["pg",""],["ls","wc"],["pc","ct"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","sh"],["at","South leads another low heart. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["hs","wh"],["at","If West follows low, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["pc","h"],["hs","nh"],["at","another finesse is taken. "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","h"],["hs","eh"],["at","When East can only produce a low card, "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["pc","h"],["at","South has his ninth trick. "],["pg",""],["nt","\nBridge players should have a good working knowledge of probabilities of suit breaks and honour distributions. Many bridge books contain tables of important bridge odds. Memorizing a handful of numbers can help solve most problems like this one."],["",""]]}}